      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>While moogle legends describe Moggle Mog as a kind, benevolent presence, the primal summoned by Mooglesguard is driven by the need to feast on ever-greater amounts of aether along with a large following to further solidify his being. - Moggle Mog</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 23, touch 19, flat-footed 16 (+1 size, +7 dex, +1 dodge, +4 natural)</p><p>HP 136 [195] (13d10+65)</p><p>Fort +13, Ref +11, Will +19</p><p>Weakness Shadow</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 20 ft., fly 30 ft. (good)</p><p>Ranged Double Charged Holy Staff +22/+17/+12 (2d6+9/x2 holy damage)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>STR 12, DEX 24, CON 20, INT 16, WIS 28, CHA 8</p><p>Base Atk +13; CMB +13; CMD +30</p><p>Feats Advanced Power Weapons Wielder, Dodge, Improved Iron Will, Improved Power Weapons Wielder, Iron Will, Skill Focus (Fly), Weapon Focus (Power Staff)</p><p>Skills Fly +33</p><p>SQ Outsider traits, Does not Breathe, Does not Eat, Does not Sleep</p>"
